(19,'Audited source-clock mapping',r'T_{\mathrm{UTC}}=T_{\mathrm{source}}+5\,\mathrm{hours}-d_{\mathrm{Europe}}(T_{\mathrm{source}})','dEurope is one hour during European summer time and zero otherwise. A02 records the evidence, scope and retrospective nature of this correction.')
